                + " cobble=" + amount(data, Items.COBBLESTONE)
                + "；上方剩 oak=" + countIn(barrel, Items.OAK_LOG)
                + " cobble=" + countIn(barrel, Items.COBBLESTONE)
                + "；漏斗格 " + snapshot(hopper));
        check("I1 白名单内的橡木全进库（" + amount(data, Items.OAK_LOG) + "）",
                amount(data, Items.OAK_LOG) == 10);
        check("I2 白名单外的圆石一个没进库（" + amount(data, Items.COBBLESTONE) + "）",
                amount(data, Items.COBBLESTONE) == 0);
        check("I3 圆石原样留在上方桶里（" + countIn(barrel, Items.COBBLESTONE) + "）",
